[h3]November Quality of Life update[/h3]

[list]
[*] Copy Settings now transfers a building's temperature limits through U60's building event. PLib has been updated for the new game version.
[*] Sweep errands check each bin against the material's temperature before choosing a destination. A bin that rejects the material leaves the next eligible bin available.
[*] Reachable bins requesting the same material contribute their individual temperature ranges. Bins with different material filters are each checked even when the game groups those filters under the same hash. Ranges stay separate across parent worlds.
[/list]

[b]Fast Track compatibility[/b]

Delivery Temperature Limit runs on its own. Fast Track support is best-effort. Fast Track Beta 0.18.6.0 uses the former game APIs in its default pickup and reachability options. Leave Fast Track disabled for this release. No settings combination has completed paired in-game checks.

This release targets the November Quality of Life update. Existing temperature limits use the same saved fields.
